# Build context (estandar-backend.md §7): only what is needed to restore and publish reaches the daemon.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Tests never ship: the image publishes a host project, and excluding them keeps the context small.
Tests/
docs/
infra/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Specs live outside git and outside the images.
Spec/

# Secrets never enter a layer, not even one that is later discarded.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/*.env
.env*
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.p12

**/.DS_Store
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
